  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The share of the atom present at corner of the cube is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></math>. The share of the atom at face centre is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Hence, the molecule can be represented as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>(Empirical formula)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.</p>",
